{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268uJgZWlrAg1794540450.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地衛星互聯網企業國星宇航首日掛牌，股價「潛水」，開報24.44元，較招股價24.9元，低百分之1.8。以每手100股，不計手續費，一手帳面蝕46元。</p><p></p><p>股份公開發售部分錄得2.4倍超額認購，一手中籤率百分之60，國際發售超購約0.79倍。集資淨額約6.5億元，用於提升研發能力等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T04:35:43.660710+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T03:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T21:36:47.728611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T04:29:06.505246+00:00","content_hash":"ec02229dae2ee26cde5be23e3193b0e9e7d88911b32a61be81011fe091fe80bb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T04:35:43.660710+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}